{
  "title": "Papagato crece: niveles 4 a 7 y Siete vidas",
  "description": "Lo que le faltaba a Papagato (docs/animas/papagato/): a nivel 7 en un combate de prueba, con Siete vidas comprada en el bote. Acecho agazapada y su salto al empezar la ronda; Siete vidas despertando al gastar una herida de cinco, su golpe sobre todos y la custodia de Yuki convirtiendo un golpe mortal en cura; Cacería sobre dos heridas; después, la pantalla de victoria al subir a los niveles 4, 5 y 7.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "open": "/?story=papagato-7&solo=1&fight=%7B%22adult%22%3Atrue%2C%22partner%22%3Atrue%2C%22wear%22%3A%7B%22gerard%22%3A%22papagato%22%7D%2C%22animas%22%3A%5B%22matemagico%22%2C%22papagato%22%2C%22tecnopata%22%5D%2C%22friends%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22encounter%22%3A%22dogs%22%2C%22foes%22%3A3%2C%22free%22%3Atrue%2C%22immune%22%3Afalse%2C%22unbound%22%3Afalse%2C%22improved%22%3A%5B%22papagato%3Adefinitiva%22%5D%7D"
    },
    {
      "eval": "navigator.getGamepads = () => []"
    },
    {
      "until": "!!window.gerard && document.querySelector('#battle .turn-meta')?.textContent === 'TU TURNO'",
      "timeout": 120000
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.ui = window.gerard.battleUI; window.turn = id => document.querySelector('#battle .turn-meta')?.textContent === 'TU TURNO' && document.querySelector('.battle-dock[data-dock=\"1\"]')?.dataset.member === id && !ui.fight?.busy; window.skill = id => document.querySelector('.skill-list [data-skill=\"' + id + '\"]')?.click(); window.aim = () => document.querySelector('.battle-target[data-side=\"foes\"]:not(:disabled)')?.click(); window.defend = () => document.querySelector('.battle-dock[data-dock=\"1\"] [data-command=\"defend\"] .command-trigger')?.click(); window.fresh = () => ui.tweak(s => { s.foes.forEach(f => { f.hp = f.maxHp = 400; delete f.statuses; }); s.allies.forEach(a => { a.hp = a.maxHp; }); }); window.fresh();"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.turn && window.turn('gerard')",
      "timeout": 60000
    },
    {
      "press": "Digit2",
      "gap": 500
    },
    {
      "press": "ArrowDown",
      "times": 5,
      "gap": 150
    },
    {
      "shot": "habilidades",
      "delay": 400,
      "caption": "Papagato a nivel 7: Acecho (Nv 6) y Cacería (Nv 7) al final de la lista, y cuatro círculos de maná desde el nivel 4"
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.skill('acecho')"
    },
    {
      "wait": 400
    },
    {
      "record": "acecho-se-agazapa",
      "seconds": 2,
      "fps": 30,
      "tiles": 12,
      "each": "window.frame === 0 && window.aim()",
      "caption": "Nv 6 · Acecho: todavía no golpea; Haru se agazapa y avanza hacia la presa"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.turn && window.turn('aitor')",
      "timeout": 60000
    },
    {
      "shot": "agazapada",
      "delay": 900,
      "caption": "Haru sigue agazapada mirando a su presa, y el ojo de gato en la placa de Gerard: saltará al empezar la ronda"
    },
    {
      "record": "acecho-salta",
      "seconds": 9,
      "fps": 20,
      "tiles": 18,
      "each": "window.frame === 0 && window.defend()",
      "caption": "Aitor se defiende, los perros pasan y, al empezar la ronda y antes de que nadie elija, Haru salta: golpe crítico seguro"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.turn && window.turn('gerard')",
      "timeout": 60000
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.fresh(); ui.tweak(s => { s.foes[0].statuses = { sangrado: 5 }; s.foes[0].cutRound = s.round; });"
    },
    {
      "press": "Digit2",
      "gap": 500
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.skill('llaga')"
    },
    {
      "wait": 400
    },
    {
      "record": "siete-vidas-despierta",
      "seconds": 2.8,
      "fps": 30,
      "tiles": 12,
      "each": "window.frame === 0 && window.aim()",
      "caption": "Gastar una herida de cinco con Olor a sangre es crítico seguro, y despierta la definitiva: «Siete vidas · Definitiva · despierta» sobre Gerard"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.turn && window.turn('aitor')",
      "timeout": 60000
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.defend()"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.turn && window.turn('gerard')",
      "timeout": 60000
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.fresh()"
    },
    {
      "press": "Digit2",
      "gap": 500
    },
    {
      "shot": "definitiva-en-la-lista",
      "delay": 400,
      "caption": "Despierta, Siete vidas encabeza la lista: una vez en el combate, sin maná"
    },
    {
      "record": "siete-vidas",
      "seconds": 3.4,
      "fps": 30,
      "tiles": 15,
      "each": "window.frame === 0 && window.skill('siete-vidas')",
      "caption": "Siete vidas: Haru pasa por cada enemigo y los deja sangrando; Yuki recorre el equipo y deja un anillo blanco a sus pies"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.turn && window.turn('aitor')",
      "timeout": 60000
    },
    {
      "shot": "custodia",
      "delay": 700,
      "caption": "La cabeza de gato en la placa de cada uno mientras dura: el próximo golpe que fuera a tumbar a alguien del equipo lo cura"
    },
    {
      "eval": "ui.tweak(s => { s.allies.find(a => a.id === 'gerard').hp = 1; })"
    },
    {
      "record": "siete-vidas-salva",
      "seconds": 7,
      "fps": 20,
      "tiles": 18,
      "each": "window.frame === 0 && window.defend()",
      "caption": "Gerard a 1 PV: el golpe que lo tumbaría se para, Yuki está delante y el número rojo se da la vuelta en una cura verde, «¡Siete vidas!»"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.turn && window.turn('gerard')",
      "timeout": 60000
    },
    {
      "shot": "salvado",
      "delay": 600,
      "caption": "Gerard sigue en pie, con lo que le iban a quitar de más; la custodia se ha gastado para todo el equipo"
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.fresh(); ui.tweak(s => { s.foes[0].statuses = { sangrado: 6 }; s.foes[1].statuses = { sangrado: 3 }; s.foes.forEach(f => { f.cutRound = s.round; }); });"
    },
    {
      "press": "Digit2",
      "gap": 500
    },
    {
      "wait": 600
    },
    {
      "record": "caceria",
      "seconds": 3.6,
      "fps": 30,
      "tiles": 15,
      "each": "window.frame === 0 && window.skill('caceria')",
      "caption": "Nv 7 · Cacería: un zarpazo por cada sangrado del campo, solo a quien sangra; Haru y Yuki se reparten las garras y la herida de seis es toda crítica"
    },
    {
      "open": "/?story=papagato-7&solo=1&fight=%7B%22adult%22%3Atrue%2C%22partner%22%3Atrue%2C%22wear%22%3A%7B%22gerard%22%3A%22matemagico%22%2C%22aitor%22%3A%22papagato%22%7D%2C%22animas%22%3A%5B%22matemagico%22%2C%22papagato%22%2C%22tecnopata%22%5D%2C%22friends%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22encounter%22%3A%22escolta%22%2C%22foes%22%3A1%2C%22free%22%3Atrue%2C%22immune%22%3Atrue%2C%22unbound%22%3Afalse%2C%22improved%22%3A%5B%5D%7D"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.gerard && window.gerard.battleUI.fight && window.gerard.battleUI.fight.phase === 'player' && !window.gerard.battleUI.fight.busy && !document.querySelector('#battle[data-entering]')",
      "timeout": 120000
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.ui = window.gerard.battleUI; ui.setAnimas(['matemagico', 'papagato', 'tecnopata'], { papagato: 3 }); ui.refresh?.()"
    },
    {
      "wait": 800
    },
    {
      "eval": "ui.jumpTo('won-level')"
    },
    {
      "until": "document.querySelector('.xp-card[data-up] .xp-learn:not([hidden])')",
      "timeout": 15000
    },
    {
      "shot": "nivel-4",
      "delay": 400,
      "caption": "Nivel 4: la tarjeta lo dice, «Gana Maná +1»"
    },
    {
      "open": "/?story=papagato-7&solo=1&fight=%7B%22adult%22%3Atrue%2C%22partner%22%3Atrue%2C%22wear%22%3A%7B%22gerard%22%3A%22matemagico%22%2C%22aitor%22%3A%22papagato%22%7D%2C%22animas%22%3A%5B%22matemagico%22%2C%22papagato%22%2C%22tecnopata%22%5D%2C%22friends%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22encounter%22%3A%22escolta%22%2C%22foes%22%3A1%2C%22free%22%3Atrue%2C%22immune%22%3Atrue%2C%22unbound%22%3Afalse%2C%22improved%22%3A%5B%5D%7D"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.gerard && window.gerard.battleUI.fight && window.gerard.battleUI.fight.phase === 'player' && !window.gerard.battleUI.fight.busy && !document.querySelector('#battle[data-entering]')",
      "timeout": 120000
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.ui = window.gerard.battleUI; ui.setAnimas(['matemagico', 'papagato', 'tecnopata'], { papagato: 4 }); ui.refresh?.()"
    },
    {
      "wait": 800
    },
    {
      "eval": "ui.jumpTo('won-level')"
    },
    {
      "until": "document.querySelector('.skill-reveal[data-anima=\"papagato\"]:not([hidden]):not([data-leaving])')",
      "timeout": 15000
    },
    {
      "shot": "nivel-5",
      "delay": 700,
      "caption": "Nivel 5: PASIVA NUEVA, Olor a sangre, que ahora se alcanza"
    },
    {
      "open": "/?story=papagato-7&solo=1&fight=%7B%22adult%22%3Atrue%2C%22partner%22%3Atrue%2C%22wear%22%3A%7B%22gerard%22%3A%22matemagico%22%2C%22aitor%22%3A%22papagato%22%7D%2C%22animas%22%3A%5B%22matemagico%22%2C%22papagato%22%2C%22tecnopata%22%5D%2C%22friends%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22encounter%22%3A%22escolta%22%2C%22foes%22%3A1%2C%22free%22%3Atrue%2C%22immune%22%3Atrue%2C%22unbound%22%3Afalse%2C%22improved%22%3A%5B%5D%7D"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.gerard && window.gerard.battleUI.fight && window.gerard.battleUI.fight.phase === 'player' && !window.gerard.battleUI.fight.busy && !document.querySelector('#battle[data-entering]')",
      "timeout": 120000
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.ui = window.gerard.battleUI; ui.setAnimas(['matemagico', 'papagato', 'tecnopata'], { papagato: 6 }); ui.refresh?.()"
    },
    {
      "wait": 800
    },
    {
      "eval": "ui.jumpTo('won-level')"
    },
    {
      "until": "document.querySelector('.skill-reveal[data-anima=\"papagato\"]:not([hidden]):not([data-leaving])')",
      "timeout": 15000
    },
    {
      "shot": "nivel-7",
      "delay": 1300,
      "caption": "Nivel 7: HABILIDAD NUEVA, Cacería"
    }
  ]
}